  "details": "Description\n\nso im in a spookality world with the hype train function and i wanted to gift vrc plus over my phone, google said the payment went through but it wasnt noted that i gifted it nor did i get the backpack, im at a lost for words and either would like my money back or get the backpack with the vrc + gift ive sent, if you need proof of the payment going through on googles end ill happily provide you with it\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nthe bug basically happens when to many people are in one world for android phone users and some one tries to gift vrc+, the game might crash and then nothing happens, no message or refund if the payment isnt successful\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Once\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p2-1921-15c4a824b2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
